NOTE: The data set WORK.REGIMES has 2 observations and 1 variables.

3844       ods graphics on;
3845       proc phreg data=Rats plot(overlay)=survival;
3846       model Days*Status(0)=Group;
3847       baseline covariates=regimes out=_null_;
