NOTE: The PROCEDURE PHREG printed page 289.

3851       proc phreg data=Rats;
3852       model Days*Status(0)=Group X;
3853       X=Group*(log(Days) - 5.4);
3854       run;

NOTE: Convergence criterion (GCONV=1E-8) satisfied.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE PHREG printed page 290.

3855       ods graphics on;
